    (uuid "c21d0b4e-531b-5794-91e1-9fb6bed37d9a"))
  (text
    "ITRIP = VREF / (R_IPROPI x 1000 uA/A), VREF 2.481 V: tracks 2.4k -> 1.034 A, swing 4.12k -> 0.602 A, actuators 4.99k -> 0.497 A. At the limit IPROPI equals VREF, inside the ADC range.\nThe 1k / 100n filter after IPROPI (100 us) smooths the PWM for the ADC without slowing the driver's own regulation. EN = PWM (0 = brake), PH = direction (1: OUT1 high)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "66328b57-387f-5884-a55e-aeaca1ecdb2e"))
